OL,3,GNEWSADUP leader says he 'hopes' Carla
OL,4,ALockhart will not leave the party
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinn Fein MP John Finucane called the
OL,7,Fmove "an example of economic sabotage,
OL,8,Fof self-harm, by the DUP all because
OL,9,Fthey struggle with internal party
OL,10,Fcohesion and once again that division".
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
